+===============================================================================
+
+6.1 SIGNATURE DETECTION OPTIMIZATION
+-------------------------------------
+
+YOLO Model Tuning:
+- Confidence Threshold: 0.28 (optimized for F1-score)
+- NMS Threshold: Default (0.45)
+- Input Size: 640x640 (balance speed/accuracy)
+- Augmentation: Disabled for inference
+
+Blob Heuristic Tuning:
+```python
+# Optimized weights for score calculation
+WEIGHT_LARGEST_BLOB = 0.4           # 40% weight for blob size
+WEIGHT_EDGE_STRENGTH = 0.28         # 28% weight for edge detail
+WEIGHT_CONTOUR_COUNT = 8.0          # 8 points per contour
+WEIGHT_INK_RATIO = 700.0            # 700 points per ink ratio unit
+
+# Adaptive thresholds
+INK_CUTOFF = 0.015                   # 1.5% minimum ink coverage
+BLOB_MIN = 18                        # 18 pixels minimum blob
+PCT_WIDTH_MIN = 0.14                # 14% minimum width coverage
+SCORE_THRESHOLD = 140.0             # Minimum combined score
+```
+
+Performance Optimizations:
+- Single YOLO pass on signature column (vs full image)
+- Pre-computed median blob for adaptive thresholds
+- Efficient band extraction (70% row height)
+- Morphological operations with optimized kernel sizes
+
+6.2 HEAD DETECTION OPTIMIZATION
+--------------------------------
