+4.3 ATTENDANCE VERIFICATION LOGIC
+The system compares results from both processing paths:
+
+python
+# Pseudocode for attendance verification
+video_result = process_video(lecture_video)
+signature_result = process_signature_sheet(attendance_sheet)
+
+# Comparison logic
+if signature_result["present_count"] < video_result["head_count"]:
+    discrepancy = video_result["head_count"] - signature_result["present_count"]
+    status = "POTENTIAL_FAKE_ATTENDANCE"
+    alert_level = "HIGH" if discrepancy > 5 else "MEDIUM"
+elif signature_result["present_count"] == video_result["head_count"]:
+    status = "ATTENDANCE_VERIFIED"
+    alert_level = "LOW"
+else:
+    status = "MORE_SIGNATURES_THAN_PEOPLE"
+    alert_level = "MEDIUM"
