+
+5. TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS AND DEPENDENCIES
+===============================================================================
+
+5.1 PYTHON DEPENDENCIES
+Core Libraries:
+
+python
+# Computer Vision and Image Processing
+cv2==4.8.1.78                    # OpenCV for image processing
+numpy==1.24.3                     # Numerical operations
+
+# Deep Learning
+ultralytics==8.0.196              # YOLO models
+
+# OCR and Text Processing
+pytesseract==0.3.10               # OCR engine
+
+# Machine Learning
+scikit-learn==1.3.0               # ML utilities
+
+# Web Framework
+fastapi==0.104.1                  # API framework
+uvicorn==0.24.0                   # ASGI server
+python-multipart==0.0.6          # File upload support
+
+# System Operations
+shutil                            # File operations
+tempfile                          # Temporary file management
+os                                # Operating system interface
+math                              # Mathematical functions
+re                                # Regular expressions
+typing                            # Type hints
+5.2 EXTERNAL DEPENDENCIES
+Tesseract OCR:
+
+Path: C:\Users\user\AppData\Local\Programs\Tesseract-OCR\tesseract.exe
+Version: 5.x (Windows)
+Purpose: OCR for text extraction (future enhancement)
+Configuration: Set in pytesseract.pytesseract.tesseract_cmd
+5.3 MODEL FILES
+Required Models:
+
+YOLO11m (yolo11m.pt):
+Size: ~50MB
