+Minimum Hardware:
+
+CPU: Intel i5 or equivalent
+RAM: 8GB minimum
+Storage: 2GB free space
+GPU: Optional (CUDA support for faster inference)
+Recommended Hardware:
+
+CPU: Intel i7 or AMD Ryzen 7
+RAM: 16GB
+GPU: NVIDIA GTX 1660 or better
+Storage: SSD for faster I/O
+===============================================================================
