+6. ALGORITHM TUNING AND OPTIMIZATION
+===============================================================================
+
+6.1 SIGNATURE DETECTION OPTIMIZATION
+YOLO Model Tuning:
+
+Confidence Threshold: 0.28 (optimized for F1-score)
+NMS Threshold: Default (0.45)
+Input Size: 640x640 (balance speed/accuracy)
+Augmentation: Disabled for inference
+Blob Heuristic Tuning:
+
+python
+# Optimized weights for score calculation
+WEIGHT_LARGEST_BLOB = 0.4           # 40% weight for blob size
+WEIGHT_EDGE_STRENGTH = 0.28         # 28% weight for edge detail
+WEIGHT_CONTOUR_COUNT = 8.0          # 8 points per contour
+WEIGHT_INK_RATIO = 700.0            # 700 points per ink ratio unit
+
+# Adaptive thresholds
+INK_CUTOFF = 0.015                   # 1.5% minimum ink coverage
+BLOB_MIN = 18                        # 18 pixels minimum blob
+PCT_WIDTH_MIN = 0.14                # 14% minimum width coverage
+SCORE_THRESHOLD = 140.0             # Minimum combined score
+Performance Optimizations:
+
+Single YOLO pass on signature column (vs full image)
+Pre-computed median blob for adaptive thresholds
+Efficient band extraction (70% row height)
+Morphological operations with optimized kernel sizes
+6.2 HEAD DETECTION OPTIMIZATION
+Frame Processing:
+
+Frame skipping based on FPS (1 frame/second)
+Top-K aggregation (7 frames) for statistical stability
+Median calculation for robust estimation
+Model Optimization:
+
+YOLO11m medium model (balance accuracy/speed)
+Verbose disabled for faster inference
+Automatic input resizing
+Memory Management:
+
+Frame-by-frame processing (no batch storage)
+Immediate count aggregation
+Efficient numpy operations
+===============================================================================
+
+7. ERROR HANDLING AND FAILURE MODES
+===============================================================================
+
+7.1 SIGNATURE DETECTION ERRORS
+Common Failure Modes:
+
+Poor Image Quality:
+Symptoms: Low contrast, blur, noise
+Detection: Low ink ratios, small blobs
+Recovery: Adaptive thresholding, blob heuristic fallback
+User Feedback: "Low image quality detected, using enhanced processing"
+Missing YOLO Model:
+Symptoms: Model loading failure
+Detection: Exception during model initialization
+Recovery: Graceful degradation to blob heuristic only
+User Feedback: "YOLO model unavailable, using fallback detection"
+No Rows Detected:
+Symptoms: Empty row_ranges list
+Detection: len(row_ranges) == 0
+Recovery: Return error with diagnostic information
+User Feedback: "No table rows detected. Check image quality and orientation."
+7.2 HEAD DETECTION ERRORS
+Common Failure Modes:
+
+Corrupted Video Files:
+Symptoms: Cannot open video, read failures
+Detection: cap.isOpened() returns False
+Recovery: Return descriptive error
+User Feedback: "Video file is corrupted or unsupported format"
+No Persons Detected:
+Symptoms: All frame counts = 0
+Detection: max(counts) == 0
+Recovery: Return zero counts with diagnostic
+User Feedback: "No people detected in video. Check lighting and camera angle."
